<title>UK: Wet Brent trades Apr -90 cts, paper a touch weaker.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades Apr -90 cts, paper a touch weaker.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent blend crude traded at a 90 cent discount to April paper on Thursday in a continuing reflection of North Sea spot market oversupply, traders said.</p>
<p>The March 29-31 loader changed hands at the same level as a March 26-28 loader sold on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The bearishness keeps on rolling forward,&quot; a trader said.</p>
</text>
